+
+## Grouped Category Summary
+
+Use `--group-by-category` to group items by category and calculate totals:
+
+```bash
+python3 -m inventory.cli examples/stock.csv --group-by-category
+```
+
+Expected output:
+```json
+[{"category": "kitchen", "quantity": 3, "stock_value": "12.75"}, {"category": "office", "quantity": 12, "stock_value": "6.00"}]
+```
+
+The `--min-quantity` filter is applied before grouping.

